{
  "_comment": "EXAMPLE ONLY. A recommended Claude Code permission allowlist for the unattended operator session. The human decides whether to install it: cp scripts/operator_settings.example.json ~/studio/operator_settings.json on the Spark. operator_tmux.sh merges it with the guard hook and deny rules (pipeline/ops/guard.py settings) into data/operator/claude_settings.json and starts claude with --permission-mode dontAsk, so anything not allowed here is refused instead of prompting. No agent installs or edits this file.",
